    "text": "Let <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be a solution of the differential equation, <math><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
